WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.543 --> 00:00:04.129
Henry got bullied at school
this morning.

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:07.173
If we leave right now

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:09.050
and take the
connecting flight

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:09.426
 through Paris,

00:00:09.426 --> 00:00:10.927
we can be in Kansas
by noon,

00:00:10.927 --> 00:00:13.513
and that punk’s house will
be in ashes by 12:30.

00:00:13.596 --> 00:00:14.472
No, no.

00:00:14.472 --> 00:00:15.807
Best thing you can do with bullies

00:00:15.807 --> 00:00:17.058
is ignore them.

00:00:18.643 --> 00:00:22.772
Then you sneak into their house at 4 a.m.

00:00:22.772 --> 00:00:24.691
which statistically speaking

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:25.942
is the hour people are

00:00:25.942 --> 00:00:27.444
least prepared to defend themselves.

00:00:27.444 --> 00:00:28.236
Correct.

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:30.155
Once you’re standing
over them

00:00:30.155 --> 00:00:32.365
as they sleep in their bed,

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:35.994
you start to beat them

00:00:36.077 --> 00:00:39.414
with a thick, heavy, rope

00:00:39.414 --> 00:00:41.416
soaked in red paint,

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:45.295
pummeling them over
and over

00:00:45.628 --> 00:00:47.547
until they wake

00:00:47.797 --> 00:00:49.841
confusing the paint
for their own blood.

00:00:51.468 --> 00:00:53.845
When they beg
you to stop,

00:00:53.845 --> 00:00:55.388
you laugh

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:58.558
as loud as you can

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:01.686
for as long as
you can

00:01:01.811 --> 00:01:02.979
and then

00:01:04.689 --> 00:01:07.192
you start to beat
them again.

00:01:17.202 --> 00:01:19.037
You know, I may just

00:01:19.037 --> 00:01:20.371
hold off on anything
like that

00:01:20.371 --> 00:01:21.956
until I connect with
Michelle

00:01:21.956 --> 00:01:22.832
and just get the details.

00:01:22.832 --> 00:01:23.917
See what actually
happened, you know?

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:25.543
Alright, yeah.
Fair enough.

00:01:25.835 --> 00:01:26.753
But thank you.

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:27.420
Oh, yeah.

